#. Translators: Description used in the snippet variable picker.
#: ui/variable_dialog.py:36
msgid "Current date and time"
msgstr "Aktuelles Datum und aktuelle Uhrzeit"

#. Translators: Description used in the snippet variable picker.
#: ui/variable_dialog.py:38
msgid "Current Unicode text from the Windows clipboard"
msgstr "Aktueller Unicode-Text aus der Windows-Zwischenablage"

#. Translators: Description used in the snippet variable picker. This is
#. the executable filename, not a possibly private window title.
#: ui/variable_dialog.py:41
