#. Translators: Label for optional variable formats or settings.
#: ui/variable_dialog.py:148
msgid "Possible &formats or settings"
msgstr "Mögliche &Formate oder Einstellungen"

#. Translators: Accessible name for optional variable
#. formats/settings.
#: ui/variable_dialog.py:154
msgid "Available variable formats or settings"
msgstr "Verfügbare Variablenformate oder Einstellungen"

